                <div class="stats-row">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-arrow">→</div>
                        <p>Our cargo service has elevating industrial supply through efficient logic and solid
                            international connectivity.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-arrow">→</div>
                        <p>Our cargo service has elevating industrial supply through efficient logic and solid
                            international connectivity.</p>
                    </div>
